  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You summon a loud spectral bee to harass a creature you can see within range. For the duration, the bee buzzes around the target, which has Disadvantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks, Dexterity (Stealth) checks, and Constitution saving throws made to maintain Concentration. The target also can’t benefit from the &amp;Reference[invisible apply=false]{Invisible} condition.</p><p>The bee follows the target, staying within 3 feet of it while the target remains within 120 feet of you. It vanishes when the spell ends or when the target moves out of range.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
